> From e54d1462ae244db3189a8b69018bc5f3e3d3b468 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
> From: Christoph Hellwig <hch@lst.de>
> Date: Tue, 14 Jun 2016 17:04:10 +0200
> Subject: scsi: move current_cmnd into the 53c700 driver
